ea:IntraRaterReliability a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:TestRetestReliability .

ea:ReliabilitySourceType a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Reliability .
ea:StudentRelatedReliability a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ReliabilitySourceType .
